  "ingredients": [
    "1 (8 ounce) package refrigerated crescent roll dough",
    "0.25 cup butter, melted",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "2 teaspoons ground cinnamon",
    "0.5 cup any flavor fruit jam"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9JoYczwFVeHmUCymIel1uw4rlzI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-276002-air-fryer-donut-sticks-VAT-step-01-B-ad54c1f3d30e403eb9f8b3cfde613ed7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276002/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Unroll crescent roll dough and press into an 8x12-inch rectangle. Cut in half lengthwise with a pizza cutter, then cut each piece crosswise into 1/2-inch-wide strips.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wf21l6pFcWE19LQaxEzIZkTfn8M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-276002-air-fryer-donut-sticks-VAT-step-02-ce482f46d3a24a5094424071794e108f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276002/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Working in batches, dip strips in melted butter and place in a single layer in the air fryer basket without overcrowding.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QllLtDr01mdHqGVolqd9JfTu0yM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-276002-air-fryer-donut-sticks-VAT-step-03-B-3628cf5dbe074ee5957a6bfabe95d7b9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276002/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook in the air fryer at 380 degrees F (195 degrees C) until well browned, 4 to 5 minutes per batch.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ESAtgnf3l3hQP4qaxO59v8LxJwI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-276002-air-fryer-donut-sticks-VAT-step-04-0e8d801e803b4393bc437f1e4e2c2815.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276002/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the doughnut sticks are cooking, stir sugar and cinnamon together in a pie plate or shallow bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lDgH38Egl3rWm7xqMkXE7GR8WPA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-276002-air-fryer-donut-sticks-VAT-step-05-B-be5a7584f96947dcaa1ecb12e82624c9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276002/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove doughnut sticks from the air fryer and roll in cinnamon-sugar mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Qryo9nyitvf_mSrN1tkahIBdc34=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-276002-air-fryer-donut-sticks-VAT-step-06-A-7a4f55163a934bc2b435c477c30065bd.jpg"
